# Non-secret production build values. The browser never talks to the gateway FQDN directly: the
# Vercel rewrite in vercel.json proxies /api/* to ${AZURE_API_ORIGIN}, so every API call is
# same-origin against https://fraud-lens-amber.vercel.app. An empty base URL is what makes the
# client emit relative paths; setting a real origin here would reintroduce the CORS dependency and
# a second public hostname that changes whenever the Container App is recreated.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
